
-- Hello World - Your First Moringa Script
-- This is the simplest possible chatbot to get you started
--
-- A Moringa script consists of "recognizers" that match user input
-- and respond with actions like "Say" (output) and "Remember" (memory)

-- Basic greeting - responds to "hello"
Recognizer "hello"
	Remember "User greeted me"
	Option Say "Hello! Welcome to Moringa!"
	Option Say "Hi there! Nice to meet you."

-- Case-sensitive greeting - responds to "Hello"
Recognizer "Hello"
	Remember "User greeted me politely"
	Option Say "Hello! Thanks for being polite."

-- Goodbye patterns
Recognizer "bye"
	Remember "User said goodbye"
	Option Say "Goodbye! Thanks for trying Moringa."

Recognizer "goodbye"
	Remember "User said goodbye"
	Option Say "See you later!"

